    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the fiddle, take a detour, go on an adventure\u2014sometimes.<br>So... what was the goal again?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinono is a curious traveler who casts magic through the sound of her fiddle.<br>Alongside her companions, she sets off on a journey to collect five magical artifacts.<br>But in this world, there's no right order\u2014no set ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions gently shape both the path and the conclusion of her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxed RPG featuring peaceful exploration,<br>turn-based combat, charming low-poly visuals,<br>and a story that cherishes small emotional moments.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy world where music and magic intertwine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters and partings with unique companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melodies are procedurally generated from the materials you collect<br>\u2500\u2500no two journeys sound the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and the freedom to stray from the main path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, picture book-inspired visual style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of Pinono\u2019s journey,<br>you may just discover what magic truly means.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play the fiddle, take a detour, go on an adventure\u2014sometimes.<br>So... what was the goal again?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pinono is a curious traveler who casts magic through the sound of her fiddle.<br>Alongside her companions, she sets off on a journey to collect five magical artifacts.<br>But in this world, there's no right order\u2014no set ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices and actions gently shape both the path and the conclusion of her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxed RPG featuring peaceful exploration,<br>turn-based combat, charming low-poly visuals,<br>and a story that cherishes small emotional moments.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy world where music and magic intertwine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters and partings with unique companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melodies are procedurally generated from the materials you collect<br>\u2500\u2500no two journeys sound the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and the freedom to stray from the main path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warm, picture book-inspired visual style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of Pinono\u2019s journey,<br>you may just discover what magic truly means.</p>",
    "short_description": "Pinono, a girl who casts magic through music, sets off on a slightly free-spirited journey. In this turn-based RPG, you'll meet unique companions and explore a whimsical world. Your choices shape the story and ending, and melodies used in magic and events are procedurally generated each time.",
